 "digests": [
  {
   "s": "HSCL",
   "n": "Himadri Speciality Chemical Limited",
   "cat": "Outcome of Board Meeting",
   "when": "2026-11-07 13:14",
   "sent": "neutral",
   "txt": "**1. The Single Most Important Fact**\n* Himadri Speciality Chemical Ltd\u2019s Board approved the issuance of a Corporate Guarantee of up to **INR 200 Crores** in favour of ICICI Bank Ltd to secure a credit facility availed by its step-down subsidiary, Sturdy Niketan Private Limited.\n\n---\n\n**2. Key Numbers Exactly as Stated**\n* **Corporate Guarantee / Credit Facility Amount:** Up to INR 200,00,00,000/- (INR 200 Crores).\n* *(Note: This filing does not contain quarterly/annual financial results such as revenue, EBITDA, or PAT).*\n\n---\n\n**3. Management Guidance, Outlook, or Forward Statements**\n* **Commission:** The Company will charge a guarantee commission on an arm\u2019s length basis for providing the Corporate Guarantee.\n* **Accounting Impact:** The Corporate Guarantee will be disclosed as a contingent liability in the financial statements of the Company.\n* **Corporate Office Shifting:** Effective November 7, 2026, the Corporate Office is shifted to *5th Floor, C6/108/ New, Budge Budge Trunk Road, Kolkata - 700088, West Bengal*. The existing premises (*Ruby House, Kolkata - 700001*) will be maintained as an additional office, and the Registered Office address remains unchanged.\n\n---\n\n**4. What a Shareholder Should Watch or Act On**\n* **Contingent Liability Exposure:** Monitor the step-down subsidiary's (Sturdy Niketan Private Limited) operational progress and debt-servicing capacity to ensure no risk of guarantee invocation.\n* **Corporate Guarantee Fee:** Track receipt of the arm's length guarantee commission income in future disclosures.\n\n---\n\n**5. One-Line Net Read**\n* **Neutral**: Routine operational support enabling financing for a step-down subsidiary, offset by a new contingent liability of INR 200 Crores."
  }
 ],
